---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="StripUnion privacy information covering site access, outbound partner links and future analytics.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow"><span class="kicker">Privacy</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead">This policy describes the current code-based StripUnion site. It will be updated whenever new analytics, forms or account features are introduced.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section shell narrow article-body">
    <h2>Site access</h2><p>StripUnion does not currently require a user account to read editorial pages. Hosting and network providers may process standard technical logs such as IP address, browser information and request timestamps for security and delivery purposes.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>When you follow an affiliate link, you leave StripUnion and the destination provider may process information under its own privacy policy. StripUnion does not control the destination provider's data practices.</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2><p>The codebase includes event hooks for future measurement of affiliate-button clicks. A third-party analytics service should not be enabled in production until its configuration and required disclosure or consent behavior are documented here.</p>
    <h2>Contact forms and accounts</h2><p>The migrated site currently does not collect personal information through a StripUnion contact form or user account system.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
